    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fSpectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>\u2014the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything \u2014 the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable \u2014 things that <i>shouldn\u2019t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one\u2026 and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder\u2014and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP, EVOLVED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a friend in upgraded <strong>split-screen and online multiplayer</strong>. Share the fear, coordinate your reports\u2026 or turn on each other when reality bends a little too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3\u00a0</strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p> ",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fSpectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>\u2014the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything \u2014 the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable \u2014 things that <i>shouldn\u2019t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one\u2026 and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder\u2014and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP, EVOLVED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a friend in upgraded <strong>split-screen and online multiplayer</strong>. Share the fear, coordinate your reports\u2026 or turn on each other when reality bends a little too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3\u00a0</strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p> ",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re not alone. You\u2019re just the only one watching. Welcome to Spectator 3\u2014the next evolution in psychological horror. Scan the feeds, spot the impossible, and hold reality together\u2014before it falls apart!",
